### 라벨 생성
POST {{baseUrl}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/labels
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "name": "버그",
  "color": "#EF4444",
  "description": "버그 수정"
}

###

### 라벨 생성 (중복 이름) — 409 예상
POST {{baseUrl}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/labels
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "name": "버그",
  "color": "#3B82F6"
}

###

### 라벨 수정
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/labels/{{labelId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "name": "긴급 버그",
  "color": "#DC2626"
}

###

### 라벨 삭제 — 204 예상
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/labels/{{labelId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

